# refiner v4 student (reports 72-77; ARM=v4): BEV KD stays on (yaml default = the ck2e2e_bevkd setting) and
#   * hazard readout: scene read on each candidate's PARENT corridor (time-free stations), every candidate reads it at
#     its own arrival time / lateral offset (station x arrival-time hazard MLPs, noisy-OR over the stations reached in
#     4 s), structured EP head, scene-free comfort head, hazard-localised lateral head;
#   * P_ref scene query (Huber on log1p pdm_progress_eff, weight 0.1, detached input of the EP head);
#   * corridor version 2 (refiner-fix B1: the extension arc ends at S_look);
#   * score KD on the parent (identity) columns only (report 72 I2; the KD calibration stays the teachers' files).
# The censored station BCE (v4.lambda_station 0.5) reads first-failure time indices: the warm-up sidecars below
# (tools/ck/v4/build_time_idx.py, built 2026-10-15 from the existing label shards, 0 consistency violations) and the
# on-policy labeler's time_idx.npy (labeler2 writes it by default).
# Teachers: the defaults (ck2T10 / ck2M10) unless E2E_CK_SET points teacher_det_run / teacher_map_run (+ kd_calib) to
# v4 teacher runs (train_ck2.py --v4-readout hazard --v4-pref-head 1 --corridor-version 2).
v4.readout=hazard
v4.pref_head=true
v4.corridor_version=2
v4.kd_parent_only=true
